sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client
    participant R as Runtime
    participant P as Perception
    participant T as Turn Manager
    participant D as Dialogue Engine
    participant L as LLM Adapter
    participant E as Expression Engine
    participant S as Speech Renderer
    C->>R: Open session / negotiate media
    C->>R: Stream microphone frames
    R->>P: Audio frames
    P-->>R: Partial transcript events
    P-->>T: Speech-end candidate + final transcript
    T->>D: Finalized user turn
    D->>L: Context + response request
    L-->>D: Response plan / text
    D->>E: Validate and resolve expression
    E-->>D: Normalized expression plan
    D->>S: Text + expression + response ID
    S-->>R: Ordered audio chunks
    R-->>C: Stream audio chunks
    C-->>R: Playback progress (if supported)
    R-->>T: Response completion
    T-->>D: Commit delivered turn state
